 (log
  (((agent "xl1")
    (kind note)
    (seq 156)
    (text
     "csharp.rkt: a C# lexer that knows regular, verbatim, interpolated (nested strings, {{ }}, format specs), raw and $$ raw strings, char literals, comments, # directives, @identifiers; no dotnet needed. Bracket check with candidate-and-verify edits, ranked by indentation violations. First version blamed the outer namespace brace and put the closer at EOF when a closer was missing inside (the unmatched brace at EOF belongs to an outer block): now candidates also come from every indentation-violation site and the finding is located at the edit. Fixture deletions of every } in Shapes.cs: 21/21 detected, 21/21 verified, 14/21 restore the original (modulo the whitespace-only line a deleted brace leaves). Gate time: 2 ms on 2000 lines, 1 ms on the fixture.")
